  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43034300",
      "title": "Digital Signature",
      "lectureOrder": 320,
      "videoOrder": 319,
      "sourceHash": "16e91fcbc87b9f62fc66952848a9e3a80afbc84d313867162e02a5ac2473da32",
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3.21,
          "en": "(gentle bright music)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.21,
          "end": 5.31,
          "en": "-: Now we know about encryption/decryption,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.31,
          "end": 7.44,
          "en": "but then there was no way to prove that the person",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.44,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "who is sending the message is actually that person.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 11.34,
          "en": "Now the way you can do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "is with the help of digital signature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 15.21,
          "en": "Now what we do here is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.21,
          "end": 17.76,
          "en": "what if we don't want to secure the information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 17.76,
          "end": 21.69,
          "en": "but we want to prove that we are the real person?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.69,
          "end": 23.717,
          "en": "Now in that case, what A will do is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.717,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "A will not encrypt the message with B's public key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 28.74,
          "en": "which he was doing before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.74,
          "end": 31.92,
          "en": "Now what A will do is A will encrypt a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.92,
          "end": 35.01,
          "en": "with its own private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.01,
          "end": 37.32,
          "en": "Remember that we are not using B's public key here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.32,
          "end": 39.18,
          "en": "We're using A's private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.18,
          "end": 42,
          "en": "Now after encryption, the packet goes to B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42,
          "end": 43.59,
          "en": "Now how B can decrypt it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.59,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "Of course, can I use a B's private key?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 49.35,
          "en": "No, because it is encrypted by A's private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 49.35,
          "end": 51.18,
          "en": "And the only way you can decrypt that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.18,
          "end": 53.13,
          "en": "is with the help of A's public key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 53.13,
          "end": 55.11,
          "en": "If the decryption is possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 55.11,
          "end": 59.37,
          "en": "that means that there's a proof that only A has sent it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "What if, let's try to attack here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 63.57,
          "en": "What if C says, \"I want to send this data.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 65.94,
          "en": "So when the message is going from A to B,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 65.94,
          "end": 68.965,
          "en": "C comes in between say, \"Hey, let me hack this message.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.965,
          "end": 70.32,
          "en": "And message is gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.32,
          "end": 72,
          "en": "Now C is sending a new message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "and which key C is going to use?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 77.19,
          "en": "C is going to use C's private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 79.05,
          "en": "And now when it goes to B,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 79.05,
          "end": 82.28999999999999,
          "en": "B is not able to decrypt that with A's public key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 82.28999999999999,
          "end": 84.51,
          "en": "It is only possible with the help of C's public key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.51,
          "end": 87.27,
          "en": "And now B knows something is wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 87.27,
          "end": 88.95,
          "en": "It's not coming from A.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "And that's how you prove that the data is not coming from A.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 93.27000000000001,
          "en": "It came from someone else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 93.27000000000001,
          "end": 95.16,
          "en": "But what if it was possible to decrypt that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 95.16,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "with A's public key?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 98.82,
          "en": "That means we have a proof that A has sent it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 98.82,
          "end": 102.33,
          "en": "Now a cannot say later that, \"Hey, I have not sent that.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 102.33,
          "end": 103.19800000000001,
          "en": "It's a proof, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 103.19800000000001,
          "end": 105.9,
          "en": "A has encrypted that with A's private key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 105.9,
          "end": 109.2,
          "en": "and only A knows its own private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 110.033,
          "en": "And that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 110.033,
          "end": 112.2,
          "en": "This is called digital signature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 112.2,
          "end": 113.78999999999999,
          "en": "But there's one problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 113.78999999999999,
          "end": 115.44,
          "en": "We don't have security.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 115.44,
          "end": 118.25999999999999,
          "en": "We do have a proof that who has sent it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 118.25999999999999,
          "end": 119.52000000000001,
          "en": "but anyone can read data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 119.52000000000001,
          "end": 122.1,
          "en": "You know, C can also read that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 122.1,
          "end": 123.831,
          "en": "Because when C gets this packet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 123.831,
          "end": 126.69,
          "en": "which says, \"Let's meet at 5:00 PM,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 126.69,
          "end": 128.73,
          "en": "C is able to decrypt it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 128.73,
          "end": 131.67,
          "en": "because A has signed it with a private key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 131.67,
          "end": 135.72,
          "en": "and to decrypt it, C can use A's public key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 135.72,
          "end": 136.77100000000002,
          "en": "You're hacked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 136.77100000000002,
          "end": 138.48,
          "en": "So how do we secure it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 138.48,
          "end": 140.28,
          "en": "So that's why we have to do double encryption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 140.28,
          "end": 141.24,
          "en": "I mean think about this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 141.24,
          "end": 144.3,
          "en": "What if you are basically first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 144.3,
          "end": 146.19,
          "en": "so let's say A want to send message to B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 146.19,
          "end": 150.3,
          "en": "First, A will use B's public key to encrypt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 151.92000000000002,
          "en": "So first layer done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 151.92000000000002,
          "end": 154.95,
          "en": "Then the same packet will be encrypted again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 154.95,
          "end": 156.48,
          "en": "with A's private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 156.48,
          "end": 158.1,
          "en": "So double encryption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 158.1,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "Now when the packet goes to B,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 162.99,
          "en": "B says, \"Okay, it is encrypted with A's private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "Let me decrypt it with A's public key.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 165.923,
          "en": "Decryption done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 165.923,
          "end": 168.84,
          "en": "That means there's a proof that A has sent it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 168.84,
          "end": 171.12,
          "en": "and then again the package is still encrypted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 171.12,
          "end": 174.94,
          "en": "So again, it will do decryption again with B's private key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 175.82999999999998,
          "end": 177.45,
          "en": "because no one knows the B's private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 177.45,
          "end": 179.94,
          "en": "And now, B got the message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 179.94,
          "end": 183.583,
          "en": "and we have achieved security as well as identity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 183.583,
          "end": 185.49,
          "en": "But what if, let's try to attack here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 185.49,
          "end": 186.69,
          "en": "So let's say C comes in between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 186.69,
          "end": 188.58,
          "en": "and say, \"Hey, I want to attack now.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 188.58,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "C receives a package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 189.84,
          "end": 193.29,
          "en": "and says, \"Okay, it is encrypted with A's private key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 193.29,
          "end": 195.15,
          "en": "Let me decrypt it with A's public key.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 195.15,
          "end": 196.29,
          "en": "Decryption done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 196.29,
          "end": 199.56,
          "en": "But now it is still encrypted with B's public key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 199.56,
          "end": 200.88,
          "en": "Can C decrypt it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 200.88,
          "end": 204.84,
          "en": "No, because C has no idea what's B's private key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 204.84,
          "end": 206.13,
          "en": "and you're safe, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 206.13,
          "end": 208.14,
          "en": "So this is how basically you achieve signature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 208.14,
          "end": 209.4,
          "en": "with encryption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 209.4,
          "end": 211.98,
          "en": "And this will be used in the upcoming session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 211.98,
          "end": 214.5,
          "en": "so I hope you understood what is cryptography,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 214.5,
          "end": 218.1,
          "en": "what is encryption/decryption, and what is signature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 218.1,
          "end": 219.993,
          "en": "See you in the next video.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
